; 2-of-3 multisig: each verify yields 1 (valid) or 0 (empty sig); the spend
; succeeds when at least two signatures are present and valid. A non-empty
; but invalid signature fails the program. (Evaluated in tests/eval.rs with
; real signatures, since it needs a transaction context.)
(< 1
   (+ (bip340_verify pk1 (bip342_txmsg) sig1)
      (bip340_verify pk2 (bip342_txmsg) sig2)
      (bip340_verify pk3 (bip342_txmsg) sig3)))
